[2026-03-15T00:20:38.705Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UY5BY7Yk5P3AuDJjhiSDe2","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I now have all the information you need. Let me compile a comprehensive summary.\n\n## Properties API Summary\n\n### File Path\n**/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/properties.ts**\n\n### Available Endpoints\n\n1. **GET /properties** (List all properties)\n   - Query parameters: `city`, `check_in`, `check_out`, `guests`, `property_type`, `min_price`, `max_price`, `min_bedrooms`, `min_beds`, `min_bathrooms`, `amenities`, `page`, `limit`\n   - Returns paginated results with filtering and availability checking\n   - Only returns properties where `is_active = true`\n\n2. **GET /properties/{propertyId}** (Get single property details)\n   - Returns complete property details including:\n     - Property information\n     - Host details (name, avatar, bio, listing count)\n     - Images\n     - Amenities\n     - Reviews with guest info\n     - Average rating and review count\n\n3. **POST /properties** (Create new property)\n   - Required fields: `host_id`, `title`, `property_type`, `price_per_night`, `max_guests`, `city`, `country`\n   - Optional fields: `description`, `cleaning_fee`, `bedrooms`, `beds`, `bathrooms`, `address`, `state`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `amenity_ids`\n   - Returns the created property\n\n4. **PUT /properties/{propertyId}** (Update property)\n   - Updatable fields: `is_active`, `title`, `description`, `price_per_night`, `cleaning_fee`\n   - Returns updated property\n\n5. **DELETE /properties/{propertyId}** (Delete/deactivate property)\n   - Sets `is_active = false` and updates `updated_at` timestamp\n   - Does NOT permanently delete - soft delete only\n   - Returns the updated property\n\n### How to Delete/Reset Properties\n\nTo delete a property via the API:\n```\nDELETE /properties/{propertyId}\n```\n\nThis soft-deletes by setting `is_active = false`. Properties with `is_active = false` are excluded from all GET list queries.\n\nTo fully reset all properties to seed data, use the seed script:\n```bash\nnpx tsx scripts/seed-db.ts <DATABASE_URL>\n```\n\nThis will:\n1. Truncate all tables (including properties)\n2. Re-seed with the original 5 properties\n\n### Seed Data Properties\n\nThe seed database includes 5 properties:\n\n1. **b1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111** - \"Cozy Downtown Loft with City Views\" (New York, Loft, $150/night)\n2. **b2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222** - \"Beachfront Villa with Private Pool\" (Miami, Villa, $450/night)\n3. **b3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333** - \"Mountain Cabin Retreat\" (Asheville, Cabin, $200/night)\n4. **b4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444** - \"Modern Austin Apartment\" (Austin, Apartment, $120/night)\n5. **b5555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555** - \"Historic Townhouse in Georgetown\" (Washington DC, Townhouse, $275/night)\n\nAll seed properties are hosted by either Sarah Chen or Mike Johnson (the two host users created in seed data)."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a65d3ef44a970872e (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 30720\ntool_uses: 5\nduration_ms: 11079</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99c20f83-7864-4a55-a0d6-29119d896fad","uuid":"788c48c1-1b36-4ab7-aed0-585ca1de65c1","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/AirbnbClone, find the Netlify function(s) that handle the properties API. I need to know:\n1. What endpoints exist (GET, POST, DELETE etc.)\n2. How to delete properties or reset them\n3. The file path of the function\n\nCheck netlify/functions/ directory for the relevant file(s). Also check how the seed data works (seed-db.ts or similar) to understand what properties exist in seed data.","agentId":"a65d3ef44a970872e","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I now have all the information you need. Let me compile a comprehensive summary.\n\n## Properties API Summary\n\n##