[2026-03-15T00:21:53.815Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DwouFXHwowf8wXr4uf5c2H","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I found the Pagination component. Here's how the active page button is styled:\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Pagination.tsx`\n\n**Active Page Styling (lines 50-54):**\n\nThe active page button is identified and styled using a conditional className:\n\n```typescript\nclassName={`w-9 h-9 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors ${\n  page === currentPage\n    ? 'bg-text text-bg'\n    : 'text-text hover:bg-bg-secondary'\n}`}\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n\n1. **Active State Indicator:** `page === currentPage` - The button compares the page number to the `currentPage` prop to determine if it's active.\n\n2. **Active Page Styling:** When active (`page === currentPage`), the button has:\n   - `bg-text` - Background color (using the \"text\" color as background)\n   - `text-bg` - Text color (using the \"bg\" color as text)\n\n3. **Inactive Page Styling:** When not active:\n   - `text-text` - Text color\n   - `hover:bg-bg-secondary` - Hover effect with secondary background color\n\n4. **Common Styling for Both States:**\n   - `w-9 h-9` - Fixed width and height (36px)\n   - `rounded-full` - Fully rounded corners\n   - `text-sm font-medium` - Small text with medium weight\n   - `transition-colors` - Smooth color transitions\n\nThe active page has an inverted color scheme (background and text are swapped) compared to inactive pages, making it visually distinct."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a3badef5bca9f9565 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 18928\ntool_uses: 3\nduration_ms: 6469</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99c20f83-7864-4a55-a0d6-29119d896fad","uuid":"d433f610-2efa-467d-8e81-c825d38e8c7b","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/AirbnbClone, find the Pagination compone